  unitName: Mystical Talon Rhein
  unitId: 20295
  unitNumber: 875
  description: 'A martial artist who escorted many civilians to Elgaia during the
    last stages of the war with the gods. Moments after barely reaching the entrance
    to Lucius''s gate, Rhein sensed an incoming attack from the God Army. Separating
    from his friends he went after the group meant to ambush them in order to buy
    time for his friends to cross the gate. It is said that this deed alone was enough
    to earn him a place in the annals of the Toltya Dojo''s history. Finally, there
    are two legends which tell of Rhein''s end: one that claims he exhausted all
    his power fighting in Grand Gaia, and one that claims that he made it safely
    to Elgaia.'
  summonDesc: They taught me how to use my powers. That's why I was able to put my
    life on the line as I fought.
  fusionDesc: Seeking power beyond one's limit can prove deadly when done incorrectly.
    You know that, right?
  evoDesc: Your heart has reached out to me! Now I know I can pull off the secret
    art of the Toltya Dojo!
  element: 2
  rarity: 5
